      "title": "Expertpro Realty Pvt Ltd. entered into a definitive agreement to acquire remaining 50% stake in High Class Projects Ltd. from Vipul Limited (BSE:511726) for INR 43.8 million.",
      "body": "Expertpro Realty Pvt Ltd. entered into a definitive agreement to acquire remaining 50% stake in High Class Projects Ltd. from Vipul Limited (BSE:511726) for INR 43.8 million on February 18, 2026. Upon completion, High Class Projects Ltd will cease to be an associate company of Vipul Limited and will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Expertpro Realty Pvt Ltd.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, High Class Projects Ltd. reported total revenue of INR 33.7 million.\n\nThe expected completion of the transaction is February 18, 2026.",
